---
// Shared next-step block for the two location pages, so both read the same.
// Deliberately only two links: the process, then the gear.
---

<section class="next-steps" aria-labelledby="next-steps-label">
  <p class="next-label" id="next-steps-label">Next step</p>
  <ul class="next-list">
    <li>
      <a href="/quick-start/">How I'd do it, step by step</a> — the field process
      start to finish: find the fresh mound, probe for the main run, set, confirm.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/best-gopher-traps/">The traps I use</a> — the short list, with what
      each one is good at and where it gives you trouble.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .next-steps {
    background: #065f46;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .next-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #6ee7b7;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .next-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: #ecfdf5;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.93rem;
  }

  .next-list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .next-list a {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .next-list a:hover {
    color: #a7f3d0;
  }
</style>
